## Goal
Replace cloud speech-to-text for voice takes with on-device iOS dictation. The user just tried iOS 26 on-device dictation and found it excellent; speed is the driver. Current numbers on the fridge take today (iPhone 12, iOS 26.6): stop tap → card ≈ 6.6 s; backend total 3140 ms of which sttMs 913 (gpt-4o-mini-transcribe via OpenRouter), parseMs 1405, storageGetMs 223, getJobMs 417, schedulerDelayMs 190; upload + job pickup account for the rest.

