- Recording: expo-av `Audio.Recording`, 16 kHz mono AAC m4a 32 kbps (`lib/recordingPreset.ts:22-43`), singleton start/stop in `lib/audio.ts:107-211`, metering listener for the VoiceMeter UI `lib/audio.ts:85-94`, stop tap → `onRecordingComplete(uri, traceId, tStopTap)` `components/RecordingOverlay.tsx:243-260`.
